{"5029430":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Empty House","steam_appid":5029430,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5184230],"detailed_description":"Empty House is an online co-op survival horror game for up to 4 players. You are part of a vaccine retrieval crew sent into a zombie-infested zone. To fill your vaccine quota, you must enter abandoned houses crawling with zombies. Find the vaccines with your teammates and bring them back to the base.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cover yourself in zombie blood and step into the horde<\/strong><\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/ad9ce787192512efae715bd423319c12.poster.avif?t=1793739862\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/ad9ce787192512efae715bd423319c12.webm?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/ad9ce787192512efae715bd423319c12.mp4?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Smear zombie blood on your body and mimic the way they walk. If the zombies in front of you mistake you for one of their own, you can walk right through the horde. Keep walking with confidence, even when you want to run. Just get out before your disguise wears off.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn which zombie you're facing<\/strong><\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/de69a55015ece9b5e01f47c4b048b3aa.poster.avif?t=1793739862\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/de69a55015ece9b5e01f47c4b048b3aa.webm?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/de69a55015ece9b5e01f47c4b048b3aa.mp4?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Not every zombie falls for your act. Keep your footsteps quiet around sound-sensitive zombies, and shine your flashlight on zombies that freeze in the light. Learn the traits of the zombies you encounter in abandoned houses and use that knowledge to make your way through.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather oil for the next abandoned house<\/strong><\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/4d62a6f193c34f60222097c9ce39e565.poster.avif?t=1793739862\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/4d62a6f193c34f60222097c9ce39e565.webm?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/4d62a6f193c34f60222097c9ce39e565.mp4?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Put the scrap you bring back into the base's grinder to extract oil. Oil is the fuel you need to reach the next abandoned house and the currency for buying gear. Decide with your teammates whether to buy more equipment or save enough oil for the next abandoned house. There are still more places to search for vaccines.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go in together. Come back together.<\/strong><\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/0f2230b34f535e747013f92d4abb8a1d.poster.avif?t=1793739862\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/0f2230b34f535e747013f92d4abb8a1d.webm?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/0f2230b34f535e747013f92d4abb8a1d.mp4?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Finding the vaccines doesn't finish the job. You still have to carry them back through the zombies to the base. Use a variety of gear and help each other meet the quota. If you think you can make it through the horde alive, return to the base with your teammates.","about_the_game":"Empty House is an online co-op survival horror game for up to 4 players. You are part of a vaccine retrieval crew sent into a zombie-infested zone. To fill your vaccine quota, you must enter abandoned houses crawling with zombies. Find the vaccines with your teammates and bring them back to the base.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cover yourself in zombie blood and step into the horde<\/strong><\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/ad9ce787192512efae715bd423319c12.poster.avif?t=1793739862\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/ad9ce787192512efae715bd423319c12.webm?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/ad9ce787192512efae715bd423319c12.mp4?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Smear zombie blood on your body and mimic the way they walk. If the zombies in front of you mistake you for one of their own, you can walk right through the horde. Keep walking with confidence, even when you want to run. Just get out before your disguise wears off.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn which zombie you're facing<\/strong><\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/de69a55015ece9b5e01f47c4b048b3aa.poster.avif?t=1793739862\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/de69a55015ece9b5e01f47c4b048b3aa.webm?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/de69a55015ece9b5e01f47c4b048b3aa.mp4?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Not every zombie falls for your act. Keep your footsteps quiet around sound-sensitive zombies, and shine your flashlight on zombies that freeze in the light. Learn the traits of the zombies you encounter in abandoned houses and use that knowledge to make your way through.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather oil for the next abandoned house<\/strong><\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/4d62a6f193c34f60222097c9ce39e565.poster.avif?t=1793739862\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/4d62a6f193c34f60222097c9ce39e565.webm?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/4d62a6f193c34f60222097c9ce39e565.mp4?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Put the scrap you bring back into the base's grinder to extract oil. Oil is the fuel you need to reach the next abandoned house and the currency for buying gear. Decide with your teammates whether to buy more equipment or save enough oil for the next abandoned house. There are still more places to search for vaccines.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go in together. Come back together.<\/strong><\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/0f2230b34f535e747013f92d4abb8a1d.poster.avif?t=1793739862\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/0f2230b34f535e747013f92d4abb8a1d.webm?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/extras\/0f2230b34f535e747013f92d4abb8a1d.mp4?t=1793739862\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Finding the vaccines doesn't finish the job. You still have to carry them back through the zombies to the base. Use a variety of gear and help each other meet the quota. If you think you can make it through the horde alive, return to the base with your teammates.","short_description":"Online co-op survival horror for up to 4 players. Mimic zombies and walk boldly through the horde. Search abandoned houses for vaccines and bring them back to the base. Stay alert: different zombies threaten your journey. Gear up, work together, and meet your quota.","supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/7c5bcd5b9e1477012391dcece7961631f980f6ad\/header.jpg?t=1793739862","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/8661cb39279f2b9ab776680be42e8985d95a0ff9\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793739862","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/8661cb39279f2b9ab776680be42e8985d95a0ff9\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793739862","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit (버전 21H2 이상)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB \/ AMD RX 580 8GB<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 15 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-12400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 \/ AMD RX 6600 XT<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 15 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12 Monterey<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5 (2018 or newer)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal-capable GPU (Apple M1 integrated GPU or AMD Radeon Pro 560X or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 6 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 14 Sonoma or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M2 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M2 integrated GPU or AMD Radeon Pro 5500M or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 6 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Studio 301"],"publishers":["Studio 301"],"demos":[{"appid":5184230,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":799,"final":639,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"$7.99","final_formatted":"$6.39"},"packages":[1744047],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Empty House","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1744047,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Empty House - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$7.99<\/span> $6.39","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":639}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":70,"description":"Surround Sound"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"29","description":"Massively Multiplayer"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/e585f7a4c4cd41bd7ff285607588754cd0917a41\/ss_e585f7a4c4cd41bd7ff285607588754cd0917a41.600x338.jpg?t=1793739862","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/e585f7a4c4cd41bd7ff285607588754cd0917a41\/ss_e585f7a4c4cd41bd7ff285607588754cd0917a41.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793739862"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5029430\/85e07ec7f0c3771ae6413fa5d4e48167abd331b3\/ss_85e07ec7f0